; Expands the previous stub step list into the full Gunness route.
; Not playthrough-verified.

[Solution:overview:Overview]

Complete the quest through the Celtic otherworld and return via the
ring of crystals.

Primary walkthrough: Jacob Gunness (May 1999) via the Classic
Adventures Solution Archive (https://solutionarchive.com/file/id,825/),
with thanks recorded there to Zeljko Juric for the ending.

#LIST
{ Wear Lug's helmet for the causeway warrior }
{ Wear the white cloak for fire walls }
{ Wear the amulet in the Vale of Whispers }
{ Silver is unimportant; food only if energy runs low (Gunness) }
LIST#

[Solution:notes-tips:Key Requirements]

#TABLE(default,centre)
{ =h Situation | =h Requirement }
{ Causeway warrior | Wear Lug's helmet }
{ Hillfort guard | GIVE SALT TO GUARD }
{ Wolves | THROW MEAT TO WOLVES }
{ Bear | Sword and shield }
{ Vale of Whispers | Wear the amulet }
{ Fire wall / crystal cavern | Wear the cloak }
{ Enchanted hills | Carry the staff }
{ Fomorian after sword ritual | KILL FOMORIAN with the blue-sheen sword }
TABLE#

